{
  "bodyHash": "oKevh2wZ1lM=",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8b6d60a8-c4e0-4461-a748-379b08a9ef7a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"150\"></h1><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">這是截至最新更新為止，對 GamingWithJen 的巨型房屋（使用與原版不同的種子）最精確的重現。</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_543e10a2-ac13-4691-8aa4-e5461318dc02.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4ad10482-d92b-471d-a9fc-649259ed3118.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">你進入的第一個房間是客廳。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_abeceafc-3a05-4d66-a64b-f444c96d7721.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">從這裡你可以進入 Jen 的房間、附魔室和廚房。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c174e97e-d0c9-4c25-a813-3c053b87340d.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_819a066b-a56e-4ca3-b994-dcee34eef3f5.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_526245c1-80fc-4753-b6b6-f83b8b60e791.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">從廚房你可以通往樓上區域，從那裡可以進入多個房間。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_acec19dc-35e7-467e-ada7-bc808c03cf2c.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">現在我不會對你可以參觀的地方做太多詳細介紹，因為那樣會破壞體驗！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">整個重現過程花了我大約兩週時間，其中大部分時間都花在室內裝飾上（裝飾頭顱、盔甲架）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">房屋周圍的許多景觀（山脈和丘陵、沙漠生態域）大多是虛構的，我的意思是它們是使用 WorldEdit 製作的。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">我必須給予應有的讚譽，以下是我用來將這個重現做到近乎 1:1 的影片（當然有一些改動）。</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OXkZsYjWhso\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zfyU_tUUIdY?si=GFghciUGuigRE8cS\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/paiWrr52gEc\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">對於 GamingWithJen 和 PopularMMOs 製作的原始影片，我基本上必須逐幀查看兩個影片，以獲得最準確的結果！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">如果你們喜歡我的作品，請訂閱我的 YouTube 頻道或在 Patreon 上支持我！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">也請留下評論，讓我知道你是否遇到任何問題，我會盡可能回覆你們 ;)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtube.com/@Skyuten\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCUP_fMnMIZ36zlZ8nt3ozwg?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Skyuten&amp;labelColor=#000000&amp;color=#FF0000&amp;link=https://www.youtube.com/@Skyuten\" alt=\"YouTube 頻道訂閱數\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/Skyuten\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api/?username=Skyuten&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=#FFFFFF&amp;labelColor=#000000&amp;color=#d3d3d3&amp;link=https://patreon.com/Skyuten?utm_medium=unknown&amp;utm_source=join_link&amp;utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&amp;utm_content=copyLink\" alt=\"端點徽章\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
